    <item>
      <title>Behind the 8 ball: The story of jazz organist Baby Face Willette</title>
      <link>https://onmilwaukee.com/articles/baby-face-willette</link>
      <description>With a name as suited to a Prohibition-era gangster as to a diminutive, sharp-dressed musician with a winning smile, the late jazz organist "Baby Face" Willette feels almost mythical. And the fact that he spent time in Milwaukee, not only pursuing a career, but building a life, albeit briefly, feels a bit like fiction. We try to uncover the facts.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://onmilwaukee.com/articles/baby-face-willette</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://onmilwaukee.com/images/articles/ba/baby-face-willette/baby-face-willette_fullsize_story1.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Feb 2026 15:01:00 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
